      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيِّدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A camel whereby a man conceals himself
from the animal that he would shoot, previously
to his shooting at it;</i> (ISd;) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرِيْئَةٌ</span>; (A, L;)
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَيِّقَةٌ</span>. (A.)

